      "comment": "Zurvan: The Masked Swordsman",
      "content": "Zurvan found a man in the wilderness, half-monstrous but without a monstrous aura, gripping a ring. After he awoke he said he was a Dahri swordsman, alive only because he had been cursed. They fought together; later he left with a golden-haired traveller. She asks the Traveler to say hello for her.",
