      "comment": "Zurvan: The Great Songs of Khvarena",
      "content": "Zurvan used these songs to seal the Vourukasha Oasis and the ruins after the dark hollow's followers attacked, and kept one hidden herself. Only a Bloomguard can touch them, and gathering them lets the Rite of Chinvat open a path into the Harvisptokhm.",
