      "comment": "Zurvan: The Rite of Ab-Zohr",
      "content": "A ritual that purifies the Harvisptokhm of defilement, normally performed under the trees that suppress darkness. Zurvan took part in the first one 500 years ago with the swordsman, the sage and the Skeptics; the Traveler and Sorush performed another in 3.6 inside the Harvisptokhm.",
