      "comment": "Zurvan: Plumes of Purifying Light",
      "content": "Zurvan explains that Pari who cannot return to the Oasis become Plumes of Purifying Light or leave fragmentary memories in Fravashi Trees. Offering a Plume to the Amrita Pool lets it return to the Oasis; she gives this task to the Traveler as Sorush's Yasnapati.",
